.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# Quarto build outputs and caches
/_book/
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
# NOTE: _freeze/ is intentionally committed so CI (gh-pages) can render the book
# without R and without the non-CRAN packages. That set is larger than any list
# kept here would stay accurate; hvtiR::members() is the current
# one, plus ggsankey. Re-render locally to refresh the cache.

# Stray render artifacts from single-file (standalone) renders
/*_files/
/site_libs/

# R's default graphics device writes here when a plot is drawn with no device
# explicitly open. A full `quarto render` leaves one in the repo root, where it
# shows up untracked and is easy to commit by accident. Nothing needs it.
/Rplots.pdf

# Generated book deliverables (produced by `quarto render`)
/HVTI-Recipes.tex
/HVTI-Recipes.pdf

# Old/auxiliary LaTeX build leftovers
*.log
index.tex
